{"name":"Bad Hair Day","hex":"#f1c983","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bad hair day","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A day when one's hair seems unmanageable. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A day when things seem to be unmanageable or go wrong."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bad_hair_day"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bad Hair Day","blocks":[{"text":"Bad Hair Day is the ninth studio album by the American parody musician \"Weird Al\" Yankovic, released on March 12, 1996. It was Yankovic's last studio album for the Scotti Brothers label before it was purchased by Volcano Entertainment in 1999. The album produced an array of hit comedy singles; lead single \"Amish Paradise\", which lampoons both Coolio's \"Gangsta's Paradise\" and the Amish lifestyle, charted at No. 53 on the Billboard Hot 100, while \"Gump\", which parodies \"Lump\" by the Presidents of the United States of America and the movie Forrest Gump, peaked at No. 102."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/49/BadHairDayCover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bad_Hair_Day","wikidata":"Q2398241"},{"title":"Bad Hair Day (2015 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Bad Hair Day is a 2015 crime comedy film released as a Disney Channel Original Movie which premiered on February 13, 2015, starring Laura Marano and Leigh-Allyn Baker. The story centers on 16-year-old Monica Reeves, who is running for Prom Queen at her high school. One day, she wakes up with crazy hair after combining loads of different products. But Monica soon has bigger things to worry about when ex-police Lieutenant Elizabeth \"Liz\" Morgan arrives at Monica’s door in search of a $7 million diamond necklace. The two become unlikely friends as they race to fix Monica’s hair for prom and protect the necklace from falling into the hands of a world-renowned jewel thief, Pierce Peters."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/87/Bad_Hair_Day_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bad_Hair_Day_(2015_film)","wikidata":"Q18636702"},{"title":"Hair","blocks":[{"text":"Hair is a protein filament that grows from follicles found in the dermis. Hair is one of the distinguishing characteristics of mammals.\nThe human body, apart from areas of glabrous skin, is covered in follicles which produce thick terminal and fine vellus hair. Most common interest in hair is focused on hair growth, hair types, and hair care, but hair is also an important biomaterial primarily composed of protein, notably alpha-keratin."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Gray945.png/330px-Gray945.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hair","wikidata":"Q28472"},{"title":"Day","blocks":[{"text":"A day is the time period of a full rotation of the Earth with respect to the Sun. On average, this is 24 hours. As a day passes at a given location it experiences morning, afternoon, evening, and night. This daily cycle drives circadian rhythms in many organisms, which are vital to many life processes."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Day","wikidata":"Q573"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Lancaster_County_Amish_03.jpg/500px-Lancaster_County_Amish_03.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Lancaster_County_Amish_03.jpg/500px-Lancaster_County_Amish_03.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"In \"Amish Paradise\", Yankovic raps about the simple Amish way of life in an ironically boastful style.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALancaster_County_Amish_03.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Coolio.jpg/500px-Coolio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Coolio.jpg/500px-Coolio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Coolio felt that \"Amish Paradise\" \"desecrat[ed]\" his song","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACoolio.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/92/Bad_Hair_Day_-_The_Videos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/92/Bad_Hair_Day_-_The_Videos.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABad_Hair_Day_-_The_Videos.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/CSIRO_ScienceImage_8115_Human_hair_and_Merino_wool_fibre.jpg/500px-CSIRO_ScienceImage_8115_Human_hair_and_Merino_wool_fibre.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/CSIRO_ScienceImage_8115_Human_hair_and_Merino_wool_fibre.jpg/1280px-CSIRO_ScienceImage_8115_Human_hair_and_Merino_wool_fibre.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/CSIRO_ScienceImage_8115_Human_hair_and_Merino_wool_fibre.jpg/500px-CSIRO_ScienceImage_8115_Human_hair_and_Merino_wool_fibre.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACSIRO_ScienceImage_8115_Human_hair_and_Merino_wool_fibre.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/506_Hair.jpg/500px-506_Hair.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/506_Hair.jpg